# Commands run by the launchd job com.annibale.demo (see com.annibale.demo.plist).
# What this GPU makes of an unsigned 32-bit integer turned into a float (src/u2f_test.c), through
# OpenGL ES and none of our AIR work: with gpu=1 adreno_keep=1 it is the phone's Adreno that
# answers, through the same Mesa and the same ir3 that the window server draws with. The lock
# screen is left to settle first, as rc.jobs.gltest does.
/annibale/bin/anntouch wait 4
/annibale/bin/u2f_test
